    ],
    "text": "ACTING under the powers vested in it by Section 20(5) of the Consumer Affairs Authority Act, No. 09 of 2003, theConsumer Affairs Authority orders that no producer, importer, distributor or trader shall sell, expose or offer for sale ordisplay for sale the following varieties of rice above the Maximum Retail Price given hereunder.",
